  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Dark Flow Giant City, Gu Ye tells Fang Yuan she is tyrannical in manner with especially prominent battle strength. He adds that her lifespan had not ended, and that she turned into an immortal zombie on purpose to break through rather than as a last resort.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_dark_flow_giant_city",
        "char_gu_ye",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While she is away in Eastern Sea, Yuan tribe holds an Immortal Gu she had lent them and refuses Zombie Alliance’s yearly demands to return it.",
      "chapters": [
        744
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "fac_yuan_tribe",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With the leader gone, only Yin Liu Gong and the other two rank sevens guard the Northern Plains headquarters.",
      "chapters": [
        749
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yin_liu_gong",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources conflict:",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The question is open.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a female immortal zombie.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When she first appears, a bright red figure descends, her whole body blazing with fire that sways in the water, and her true appearance is hidden in the flames.",
      "chapters": [
        918
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She has occupied Bo Dan’s private sea area for years and refuses to return it; when he goes to beg for it back, she beats him badly.",
      "chapters": [
        893
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bo-dans-seized-sea-area",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bo_dan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She destroys Shark Demon’s underwater palace and, unable to openly seize a share of the Yu Lu blessed land invasion’s spoils because this is Zombie Alliance’s Eastern Sea headquarters and not her Northern Plains branch, frames Shark Demon and Su Bai Man through Bo Dan for stealing her rank eight immortal material. She forces a contest of three moves and shapes an orange-yellow flame into a fire bird, an immortal killer move she names Angry Bird after nearly dying to her own flames of anger while cultivating.",
      "chapters": [
        919
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "confrontation-at-shark-demons-palace",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shark_demon",
        "char_su_bai_man",
        "move_angry_bird"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges the fire bird carries wisdom path methods alongside fire path.",
      "chapters": [
        920
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "confrontation-at-shark-demons-palace",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing Shark Demon’s one finger flow shark, an immemorial desolate beast, she has no choice but to stop her attacks for the moment and recall the fire bird, and she laughs at his attempt to make her retreat.",
      "chapters": [
        920
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "confrontation-at-shark-demons-palace",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She recruits Fang Yuan and funds his attempts to refine star thought Immortal Gu, sending Bo Dan with immortal materials under a debt agreement that still collects interest on failure and can seize an Immortal Gu if repayment fails within a hundred years after success. She wants that refinement for the attack on Yu Lu blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        926
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eastern-sea-work-and-recall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_star_thought_immortal_gu",
        "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Old Ancestor Xue Hu loots Northern Plains Zombie Alliance, Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance sends her among three rank eight immortal zombies to punish him; as Northern Plains branch leader she must return from Eastern Sea, and the Yu Lu mission falls back to Shark Demon and Su Bai Man. A century earlier, crossing from Northern Plains into Eastern Sea cost her most of her wealth and left her heavily injured for eight years of recovery.",
      "chapters": [
        927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eastern-sea-work-and-recall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_ancestor_xue_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan pushes to enter Earth Trench for star night mucus, she agrees to his plan and assigns five immortal zombies to escort him, two of rank seven and three of rank six.",
      "chapters": [
        931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "escort-into-earth-trench",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_earth_earth_trench"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Hei Lou Lan kills Hei Cheng, Blazing Heaven Demoness uses a fire path immortal killer move: a small flame hand pulls Hei Cheng’s immortal aperture out as a pearl that can last seven days and seven nights before fusing into a blessed land. She says the retrieval method comes from Immortal Kong Jue’s Eastern Sea inheritance, adapted into her own fire path move, and she is an extremely rare great grandmaster.",
      "chapters": [
        944
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-path-methods",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_hei_cheng",
        "char_old_immortal_kong_jue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She had secretly planted a trace of fire path dao marks into each fire path immortal material she funded for Fang Yuan’s star thought Immortal Gu refinement, ruining it, and admits as much when confronted. She sees her own image in Fang Yuan’s willingness to take life threatening risks rather than let another profit, the same attitude with which she once destroyed a fragment world of the immemorial nine heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        946
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sabotaged-gu-refinement-and-past-defiance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She suffers from time path injuries and placed her hope in Hei Fan’s time path inheritance, so she took charge of Su tribe, renamed her third sister Su Xian Er, and sent her to approach Hei Cheng and enter Hei tribe. Su Xian Er kept pursuing the inheritance and gradually exposed her traces, but she truly loved Hei Cheng and stayed in Hei tribe, and Hei Lou Lan is her daughter. Hei Cheng then killed Su Xian Er in secret to prolong his own life.",
      "chapters": [
        946
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "family-and-time-path-injury",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_fan",
        "char_su_xian",
        "fac_hei_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The injury makes time pass for her very fast, and it is why she had to become an immortal zombie.",
      "chapters": [
        1101
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "family-and-time-path-injury",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her immortal zombie body is five meter tall. Her skin is rough and dark like tree bark. Her hair looks like messy red wheat stalks. She is a scary giant zombie. Orange-yellow flames cover her whole body. The zombie body shrinks to a normal person’s height. The bark-like skin vanishes and white and tender skin appears, like a freshly peeled egg. The wheat-stalk hair turns long and slim, a vibrant and warm red. She becomes a beautiful woman wearing a red dress, with tender skin, sharp features, an energetic gaze, and bright red lips. Her chest is busty. Her legs are slim and long, and they are also not thin. Her hair extends to waist length and is burning red. She then turns her body taller and becomes an immortal zombie again.",
      "chapters": [
        947
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "body-and-hair",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She learns of the rank eight Great Strength True Martial immortal zombie affair on Southern Border’s nameless mountain and relays it to Fang Yuan by letter, prompting him to investigate in person.",
      "chapters": [
        961
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-tip-off",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_great_strength_true_martial",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges that holding self strength Immortal Gu makes him certain to be targeted by Blazing Heaven Demoness.",
      "chapters": [
        973
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marked-for-her-attention",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_self_strength"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan reasons that her guilt and affection towards Hei Lou Lan is her biggest weakness, one he can turn to his advantage.",
      "chapters": [
        975
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "her-biggest-weakness",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She fights the rank eight Gu Immortals of Song clan, Cai clan, and Ruo Lai clan in white heaven, then descends laughing and leaves with Fang Yuan. Speaking secretly afterwards, one of the three says that only two of them working together can resist her, and puts her fire path attainment at great grandmaster.",
      "chapters": [
        986
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fight-with-the-three-clans",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_song_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan keeps Luo Po valley’s location hidden from Hei Lou Lan and Fairy Li Shan, reasoning that once Blazing Heaven Demoness’ demanding personality is added in, she would certainly request its use.",
      "chapters": [
        992
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "demanding-personality",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is not part of the new alliance agreement Fang Yuan struck with Hei Lou Lan and Fairy Li Shan, apparently by their own arrangement to guard against him.",
      "chapters": [
        1007
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "left-out-of-the-new-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Yi Tian Mountain",
      "chapters": [
        1001
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": ", immortal zombies from all the Zombie Alliance branches appear inside the ten extreme formation, not in a conscious state and like puppets controlled by wires. Blazing Heaven Demoness is among them, and under the gazes of Fairy Li Shan and Hei Lou Lan she turns herself into immortal material and merges into the formation while Fairy Li Shan cries out for her big sister.",
      "chapters": [
        1008
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_li_shan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In that battle Hei Lou Lan’s aunts, Blazing Heaven Demoness and Fairy Li Shan, die one after the other, and Shadow Sect is the culprit.",
      "chapters": [
        1031
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later reasons that she was plotted against by Spectral Soul and died, and that her accumulated wealth must already have been taken by him.",
      "chapters": [
        1074
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When she met Hei Lou Lan, Blazing Heaven Demoness secretly handed over her fire path inheritance. Her guilt towards Hei Lou Lan was extreme, and she turned over every way she could think of to compensate her.",
      "chapters": [
        1256
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-path-inheritance-for-hei-lou-lan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s own killer move strength reversing life and death, which can return an immortal zombie to human form, is modified from Blazing Heaven Demoness’ nirvana fire.",
      "chapters": [
        1480
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "template-for-a-later-killer-move",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At great grandmaster level she is extremely sensitive to fire path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1502
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-path-dao-mark-sensitivity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
